                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="0.0" width="393" height="750"/>
                                                <subviews>
                                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="How is vaping (E-cigarettes) safer than tobacco?" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="NCM-4s-eAi" customClass="FontLM16" customModule="CalmscientIOS" customModuleProvider="target">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="20" y="20" width="353" height="50"/>
                                                        <constraints>
                                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="50" id="I2J-Zk-S1P"/>
                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="17"/>
                                                        <color key="textColor" red="0.42882183190000001" green="0.41974490879999998" blue="0.68238306049999997" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="displayP3"/>
                                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                    </label>
                                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="bJf-QB-Tik" customClass="FontLL15" customModule="CalmscientIOS" customModuleProvider="target">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="20" y="90" width="353" height="500"/>
                                                        <constraints>
                                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="500" id="Ajx-3U-9ht"/>
                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <string key="text">E-cigarettes go by many names like "e-cigs,” vapes," and "vape pens." They can look like regular cigarettes or even things like USB flash drives and pens.

These devices run on batteries and let people inhale something called aerosol. Vaping became popular because some thought it might be a less harmful choice compared to regular smoking.

Inside that aerosol, there's usually nicotine (though not always), flavors, and some other chemicals. The devices can be rechargeable, disposable, or come with tanks and mods.

Is it safer than tobacco?
E-cigarette aerosol generally contains fewer toxic chemicals than the deadly mix of 7,000 chemicals in smoke from regular cigarettes. However, e-cigarette aerosol is not harmless. It can contain harmful and potentially harmful substances, including nicotine, heavy metals like lead, volatile organic compounds and cancer-causing agents.</string>
                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="17"/>
                                                        <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                    </label>
