                                                        <constraints>
                                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="300" id="Ade-c4-lo6"/>
                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <string key="text">If you have even tried to quit once in the past, you have some idea how it feels, the challenges you experienced, and what caused you to start smoking again. That means you’ve already tasted this journey and know how tricky it can be. There are small steps you can take now to help you quit for good and increase your chances of success. Learn the skills that will help you permanently achieve a tobacco-free life.

In the following sections, you can learn about recommended strategies for overcoming potential challenges you may encounter!</string>
