                                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                    </label>
                                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="ZmH-uX-iMq" customClass="FontLL15" customModule="CalmscientIOS" customModuleProvider="target">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="20" y="60" width="353" height="300"/>
                                                        <constraints>
                                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="300" id="bsd-bg-gqj"/>
                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <string key="text">You’ve reached your quit date and committed yourself to a tobacco-free life.

Be proud! Quit smoking is like a relationship breakup and going through some losses.. You might have to break up your routine a little bit to avoid certain places, friends, and start a new routine to distract yourself. The plan requires you to think about more than just quitting smoking, but changes to your lifestyle.

There are some keys to achieve a permanent tobacco-free life.

What can you do?</string>
                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="17"/>
                                                        <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                    </label>
                                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="What new habits are helping you keep going?" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="cZ6-xa-GM8" customClass="FontLR16" customModule="CalmscientIOS" customModuleProvider="target">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="20" y="380" width="353" height="40"/>
                                                        <constraints>
                                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="40" id="hum-af-7AY"/>
                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="17"/>
                                                        <color key="textColor" red="0.42882183190000001" green="0.41974490879999998" blue="0.68238306049999997" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="displayP3"/>
                                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                    </label>
                                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="ZY5-lM-L4v" customClass="FontLL15" customModule="CalmscientIOS" customModuleProvider="target">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="20" y="440" width="353" height="180"/>
                                                        <constraints>
                                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="180" id="31K-Qj-tPq"/>
                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <string key="text">•  Do something to stay active at home
•  Call or visit a friend or family member
•  Brush your teeth
•  Play with a pet
•  Update your contact list on your cell phone
•  Try a new hobby
•  Switch to coffee with less caffeine or 
   decaf products</string>
                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="17"/>
                                                        <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
