                                        <subviews>
                                            <view contentMode="scaleToFill" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="Mdk-bx-EIp">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="0.0" width="393" height="670"/>
                                                <subviews>
                                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="“I’m tobacco free”" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="V9s-MJ-zOg" customClass="FontLM16" customModule="CalmscientIOS" customModuleProvider="target">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="20" y="20" width="353" height="20"/>
                                                        <constraints>
                                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="20" id="ZNC-d1-YiG"/>
                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="17"/>
                                                        <color key="textColor" red="0.42882183190000001" green="0.41974490879999998" blue="0.68238306049999997" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="displayP3"/>
                                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                    </label>
                                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="hIz-Vz-0qf" customClass="FontLL15" customModule="CalmscientIOS" customModuleProvider="target">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="20" y="60" width="353" height="530"/>
                                                        <constraints>
                                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="530" id="YWD-Ok-ZqE"/>
                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <string key="text">Now you are a non-smoker and are trying to stay that way. When we make changes, it’s critical to meditate on how important this change is to you and how confident you are in making this change. You want to pay attention to how your mind, body, and emotional regulation feel differently, how your attitude changed, and what you have started doing instead for better self-care.

Thinking about it helps you to not go back to your old relationship with smoking.

Now you know what to expect on this ride. It won’t hit you as a surprise when you expect ups and downs of this journey! Remember it’s all about coming up with a strategy that works for you, it’s not about your will power.

Are you out of the woods? Many people want to know how long it takes before the chance of going back to tobacco is no longer a concern. Relapse most commonly happens in the first one to three months after quitting.

However, it’s always wise to be on guard</string>
                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="17"/>
                                                        <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                    </label>
